{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"Another foster writes:\nMeet Cookie & Serena, two sweet besties looking for their forever home together!\nCookie is a calm, sweet, and noble boy with a quiet confidence. He's very independent and enjoys having his own space, but he'll happily follow you from room to room just to keep you company. He loves being near his people on his own terms and thrives with gentle affection and a calm environment where he won't feel overwhelmed.\nSerena is his playful counterpart. She's quick on her paws, loves leaping onto the windowsill to bird-watch, and never passes up the chance to stretch out in a sunny spot for a cozy sunbath. She's curious, athletic, and brings a fun, lighthearted energy wherever she goes.\nTogether, they're the perfect balance. Cookie brings the calm, Serena brings the fun, and they absolutely adore each other. Whether they're relaxing nearby, quietly keeping each other company, or sharing a cozy nap, their bond is truly special. If you're looking for two built-in best friends who will fill your home with love, companionship, and plenty of adorable moments, Cookie and Serena are ready to meet you!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=6&searchType=4&animalid=198987","id":"a9f8ba6f9122b9ffb3a0914b6a8e8c99","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/28e9ee02f7b841308aa7d96666220b35-1785531366-1785531394-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/bd0091d021a047cab1c15b45908fc3ac-1785531365-1785531365-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5da1e5d024c74c4789a2d5f52cb7896d-1785531365-1785531365-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2d1af4c7b